  "caption": "Unpopular opinion: a connection isn't a business model.\n\nKnowing the right people can open a door. A business still needs a customer with a problem worth solving.\n\nFor a Cyprus-Lebanon opportunity, we'd start with three questions.\n\nWho would pay for it?\nWhat makes the offer useful in both markets?\nWhat would stop it from working?\n\nValidate demand, check the rules and build a practical route to market before chasing a bigger network.\n\nWhat customer problem would you solve across Cyprus and Lebanon?\n\n#Cyprus #Lebanon #CyprusBusiness #BusinessDevelopment #TheSmartySolution",
